msgid "Your current password used to sign in to your account."
msgstr "Hisobingizga kirish uchun ishlatadigan joriy parolingiz."

msgid "The new password must be at least 8 characters long and cannot be entirely numeric."
msgstr "Yangi parol kamida 8 belgidan iborat bo'lishi va faqat raqamlardan tashkil topmasligi kerak."

msgid "Enter the new password again to avoid mistakes."
msgstr "Xatolikka yo'l qo'ymaslik uchun yangi parolni qayta kiriting."

msgid "The email address you registered with."
msgstr "Ro'yxatdan o'tishda ko'rsatgan email manzilingiz."

msgid "The password set for your account."
msgstr "Hisobingiz uchun belgilangan parol."

msgid "6-digit code"
msgstr "6 xonali kod"

msgid "The 6-digit code shown in your authenticator app (Google Authenticator, etc.)."
msgstr "Autentifikator ilovangizda (Google Authenticator va h.k.) ko'rsatilayotgan 6 xonali kod."

msgid "The email address used to sign in — this is used as your login."
msgstr "Tizimga kirish uchun ishlatiladigan email manzil — login sifatida shu ishlatiladi."

msgid "Your full name, shown to other employees under this name."
msgstr "Ism va familiyangiz, boshqa xodimlarga shu nom bilan ko'rinadi."

msgid "Your role in the system — permissions and visible sections are set based on this."
msgstr "Tizimdagi rolingiz — huquqlar va ko'rinadigan bo'limlar shu bo'yicha belgilanadi."

msgid "The name of the department you work in (free text)."
msgstr "Ishlaydigan bo'limingiz nomi (erkin matn)."

msgid "A contact phone number, e.g. +998901234567."
msgstr "Aloqa uchun telefon raqam, masalan: +998901234567."

msgid "Profile picture — a square image looks best."
msgstr "Profil rasmi — kvadrat shakldagi rasm eng yaxshi ko'rinadi."

msgid "The new employee's email address, used as their login."
msgstr "Yangi xodimning login sifatida ishlatiladigan email manzili."

msgid "The employee's full name."
msgstr "Xodimning to'liq ismi."

msgid "The employee's role in the system — permissions are set based on this."
msgstr "Xodimning tizimdagi roli — huquqlar shu bo'yicha belgilanadi."

msgid "The name of the department the employee works in (free text)."
msgstr "Xodim ishlaydigan bo'lim nomi (erkin matn)."

msgid "If unchecked, the employee cannot sign in (the account is blocked, but its data is kept)."
msgstr "O'chirilsa, xodim tizimga kira olmaydi (hisob bloklanadi, lekin ma'lumotlari saqlanib qoladi)."

msgid "The document's name — shown under this name in lists."
msgstr "Hujjatning nomi — ro'yxatda shu nom bilan ko'rinadi."

msgid "The document type (drawing, estimate, contract, etc.)."
msgstr "Hujjat turi (chizma, smeta, shartnoma va h.k.)."

msgid "Which project the document belongs to."
msgstr "Hujjat qaysi loyihaga tegishli ekanligi."

msgid "Which section within the project it belongs to (optional)."
msgstr "Loyiha ichidagi qaysi bo'limga (section) tegishli ekanligi (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The document version, e.g. v1, v2.1 (optional)."
msgstr "Hujjat versiyasi, masalan: v1, v2.1 (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The deadline for the document, if any (optional)."
msgstr "Hujjat bo'yicha muddat bo'lsa, shu yerda ko'rsatiladi (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The file to upload (maximum size — 50MB)."
msgstr "Yuklanadigan fayl (maksimal hajm — 50MB)."

msgid "Upload the file for the document's new version."
msgstr "Hujjatning yangi versiyasi uchun faylni yuklang."

msgid "Briefly note what changed in this version (optional)."
msgstr "Bu versiyada nima o'zgarganini qisqa yozib qo'ying (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The approval stage's name (e.g. 'Chief engineer review')."
msgstr "Tasdiqlash bosqichining nomi (masalan: 'Bosh muhandis tekshiruvi')."

msgid "The employee who reviews the document at this stage."
msgstr "Shu bosqichda hujjatni ko'rib chiqadigan xodim."

msgid "Your decision on the document: approve, reject, or send back for revision."
msgstr "Hujjat bo'yicha qaroringiz: tasdiqlash, rad etish yoki qayta ko'rib chiqishga yuborish."

msgid "Write the reason for your decision or your comment (optional)."
msgstr "Qaroringiz sababini yoki izohingizni yozing (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The template's name — shown under this name in the list when creating a document."
msgstr "Shablon nomi — hujjat yaratishda ro'yxatda shu nom bilan ko'rinadi."

msgid "Which document type the template is for (contract, act, etc.)."
msgstr "Shablon qaysi hujjat turi uchun ekanligi (shartnoma, akt va h.k.)."

msgid "A short description of the template (optional)."
msgstr "Shablon haqida qisqa izoh (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The document text. {{placeholder}} tokens such as {{client_name}}, {{project_name}}, {{budget}}, {{deadline}} are replaced with real values when the document is generated."
msgstr "Hujjat matni. {{client_name}}, {{project_name}}, {{budget}}, {{deadline}} kabi {{placeholder}} tokenlari hujjat generatsiya qilinganda haqiqiy qiymatlarga almashtiriladi."

msgid "Which project the document is generated for — {{placeholder}} tokens are filled with this project's data."
msgstr "Hujjat qaysi loyiha uchun generatsiya qilinishi — {{placeholder}} tokenlari shu loyiha ma'lumotlari bilan to'ldiriladi."

msgid "If the document needs employee info (e.g. a contract), select it here (optional)."
msgstr "Hujjatda xodim ma'lumoti kerak bo'lsa (masalan shartnoma), shu yerdan tanlanadi (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "If checked, the generated document is also saved to the project's 'Documents' section."
msgstr "Belgilansa, generatsiya qilingan hujjat loyihaning 'Hujjatlar' bo'limiga ham saqlanadi."

msgid "The record type — income (payment) or expense."
msgstr "Yozuv turi — kirim (to'lov) yoki chiqim (xarajat)."

msgid "The amount."
msgstr "Summa miqdori."

msgid "The amount's currency."
msgstr "Summaning valyutasi."

msgid "A short description of the record (optional)."
msgstr "Yozuv haqida qisqa izoh (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The expense/income category (optional)."
msgstr "Xarajat/kirim toifasi (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The date of the transaction."
msgstr "Operatsiya sanasi."

msgid "The record's status (e.g. pending, confirmed)."
msgstr "Yozuvning holati (masalan: kutilmoqda, tasdiqlangan)."

msgid "The name of the client/organization the contract is with."
msgstr "Shartnoma tuzilgan mijoz/tashkilot nomi."

msgid "The contract number (a unique identifier)."
msgstr "Shartnomaning raqami (noyob identifikator)."

msgid "The contract amount."
msgstr "Shartnoma summasi."

msgid "The date the contract was signed."
msgstr "Shartnoma imzolangan sana."

msgid "The contract's deadline."
msgstr "Shartnoma bo'yicha bajarish muddati."

msgid "The contract's current status."
msgstr "Shartnomaning joriy holati."

msgid "Upload the contract file (optional)."
msgstr "Shartnoma faylini yuklash (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "Additional notes (optional)."
msgstr "Qo'shimcha izohlar (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The employee the contract is with."
msgstr "Shartnoma tuzilgan xodim."

msgid "The project the employee works on."
msgstr "Xodim ishlaydigan loyiha."

msgid "The total amount under the contract."
msgstr "Shartnoma bo'yicha umumiy summa."

msgid "The advance amount given to the employee."
msgstr "Xodimga berilgan avans summasi."

msgid "The amount paid so far."
msgstr "Hozirgacha to'langan summa."

msgid "The department's name — shown under this name in lists."
msgstr "Bo'limning nomi — ro'yxatda shu nom bilan ko'rinadi."

msgid "A unique short code for the department; it must not repeat across other departments."
msgstr "Bo'lim uchun noyob qisqa kod, boshqa bo'limlarda takrorlanmasligi kerak."

msgid "A short description of the department (optional)."
msgstr "Bo'lim haqida qisqa izoh (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The manager responsible for this department (optional)."
msgstr "Shu bo'limga mas'ul rahbar xodim (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The department's current status: Active, Inactive, or Archived."
msgstr "Bo'limning joriy holati: Faol, Nofaol yoki Arxivlangan."

msgid "The unit's name."
msgstr "Bo'linmaning nomi."

msgid "A short code for the unit (optional)."
msgstr "Bo'linma uchun qisqa kod (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "A short description of the unit (optional)."
msgstr "Bo'linma haqida qisqa izoh (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The manager responsible for this unit (optional)."
msgstr "Shu bo'linmaga mas'ul menejer (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The unit's hierarchical level (a number)."
msgstr "Bo'linmaning ierarxik darajasi (raqam)."

msgid "The unit's current status."
msgstr "Bo'linmaning joriy holati."

msgid "The employee being added to the unit."
msgstr "Bo'linmaga qo'shilayotgan xodim."

msgid "The employee's position/role in this unit (free text)."
msgstr "Xodimning shu bo'linmadagi lavozimi/roli (erkin matn)."

msgid "The employee's direct manager (optional)."
msgstr "Xodimning bevosita rahbari (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "If checked, this is considered the employee's primary unit."
msgstr "Belgilansa, bu xodimning asosiy (birlamchi) bo'linmasi hisoblanadi."

msgid "The project's chief architect (GIP) — the employee responsible for the project (optional)."
msgstr "Loyihaning bosh inshoot arxitektori (GIP) — loyihaga mas'ul xodim (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The project's name — shown under this name in lists and reports."
msgstr "Loyihaning nomi — ro'yxatda va hisobotlarda shu nom bilan ko'rinadi."

msgid "A short description of the project (optional)."
msgstr "Loyiha haqida qisqa tavsif (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The name of the client organization or person."
msgstr "Buyurtmachi (mijoz) tashkilot yoki shaxsning nomi."

msgid "The client's contact info — phone or email."
msgstr "Buyurtmachining aloqa ma'lumoti — telefon yoki email."

msgid "The project's (construction) address."
msgstr "Loyiha (qurilish) manzili."

msgid "The project's current stage (e.g. design, construction)."
msgstr "Loyihaning joriy bosqichi (masalan: loyihalash, qurilish)."

msgid "The project's status (active, on hold, completed, etc.)."
msgstr "Loyihaning holati (faol, to'xtatilgan, yakunlangan va h.k.)."

msgid "The date the project started."
msgstr "Loyiha boshlangan sana."

msgid "The deadline set for completing the project."
msgstr "Loyihani yakunlash uchun belgilangan muddat."

msgid "The project's total budget (amount)."
msgstr "Loyihaning umumiy byudjeti (summa)."

msgid "The amount paid so far — shows what share of the budget has been paid."
msgstr "Hozirgacha to'langan summa — byudjetdan qancha qismi to'langanini ko'rsatadi."

msgid "The employee being added to the project."
msgstr "Loyihaga qo'shilayotgan xodim."

msgid "The employee's role in the project (e.g. GIP, engineer)."
msgstr "Xodimning loyihadagi roli (masalan: GIP, muhandis)."

msgid "If checked, the employee can edit the project's data."
msgstr "Belgilansa, xodim loyiha ma'lumotlarini tahrirlashi mumkin."

msgid "The date the employee's access to the project expires (optional)."
msgstr "Xodimning loyihaga kirish huquqi tugaydigan sana (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The sub-object's name."
msgstr "Sub-obyekt nomi."

msgid "The sub-object's address (optional)."
msgstr "Sub-obyektning manzili (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The chief architect (GIP) responsible for the sub-object (optional)."
msgstr "Sub-obyektga mas'ul bosh inshoot arxitektori (GIP) (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The sub-object's current status."
msgstr "Sub-obyektning joriy holati."

msgid "Which sub-object this section belongs to."
msgstr "Bo'lim qaysi sub-obyektga tegishli ekanligi."

msgid "A short code for the section."
msgstr "Bo'lim uchun qisqa kod."

msgid "The section's name."
msgstr "Bo'limning nomi."

msgid "The chief architect (GIP) responsible for the section (optional)."
msgstr "Bo'limga mas'ul bosh inshoot arxitektori (GIP) (ixtiyoriy)."

msgid "The section's current status."
msgstr "Bo'limning joriy holati."

msgid "A short, clear title for the request. E.g. \"Change facade color\"."
msgstr "So'rovning qisqa va aniq nomi. Masalan: \"Fasad rangini o'zgartirish\"."

msgid "Details about the request: what is needed, why, and what result is expected."
msgstr "So'rov haqida batafsil ma'lumot: nima kerak, nima uchun kerak, qanday natija kutilyapti."

msgid "The request type — Change: modify something existing; Clarification: ask a question; Improvement: suggest an enhancement; Issue: report a bug or defect."
msgstr "So'rov turi — Change: mavjud narsani o'zgartirish; Clarification: savol/aniqlik so'rash; Improvement: yaxshilash taklifi; Issue: xato yoki nosozlik haqida xabar."

msgid "Which project the request belongs to. Members of the selected project can see this request."
msgstr "So'rov qaysi loyihaga tegishli. Tanlangan loyiha a'zolari bu so'rovni ko'ra oladi."

msgid "The employee responsible for handling the request. If set, they get an automatic notification."
msgstr "So'rovni bajarishga mas'ul xodim. Tanlansa, unga avtomatik bildirishnoma yuboriladi."

msgid "The request's current status: Open → In progress → Resolved → Closed."
msgstr "So'rovning joriy holati: Open (ochiq) → In progress (jarayonda) → Resolved (hal qilindi) → Closed (yopilgan)."

msgid "The request's priority level: Low, Medium, or High."
msgstr "So'rovning muhimlik darajasi: Low, Medium yoki High."

msgid "Write your comment or reply about the request here."
msgstr "So'rov bo'yicha izoh yoki javobingizni shu yerga yozing."

msgid "A short, clear title for the task."
msgstr "Vazifaning qisqa va aniq nomi."

msgid "Details about the task: what needs to be done, what result is expected."
msgstr "Vazifa haqida batafsil ma'lumot: nima qilish kerak, qanday natija kutilyapti."

msgid "Which project the task belongs to."
msgstr "Vazifa qaysi loyihaga tegishli ekanligi."

msgid "The employee responsible for completing the task. If set, they get a notification."
msgstr "Vazifani bajarishga mas'ul xodim. Tanlansa, unga bildirishnoma yuboriladi."

msgid "The task's current status (to do, in progress, done, etc.)."
msgstr "Vazifaning joriy holati (bajarilishi kerak, jarayonda, bajarildi va h.k.)."

msgid "The task's priority level."
msgstr "Vazifaning muhimlik darajasi."

msgid "The deadline set for completing the task."
msgstr "Vazifani bajarish uchun belgilangan muddat."

msgid "Write your comment or question about the task here."
msgstr "Vazifa bo'yicha izoh yoki savolingizni shu yerga yozing."

msgid "Upload a file related to the task (maximum size — 50MB)."
msgstr "Vazifaga tegishli faylni yuklash (maksimal hajm — 50MB)."
